# Exists only so chezmoi creates this directory. Terraform silently ignores
# plugin_cache_dir (~/.terraformrc) when the directory is missing and falls back
# to downloading a private copy of every provider into each working directory.
#
# A zero-byte file would not work: chezmoi skips empty files unless they carry
# the empty_ attribute, and the directory would then only appear as a side
# effect of some other apply. Terraform ignores non-provider entries in the
# cache, so this file is inert.
